                  "fill": "#33292C",
                  "content": "迪士尼風格的智慧財產界線（必守）：做的是「迪士尼動畫給人的感覺」，不是迪士尼的東西",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "nAjXg",
                  "name": "列-1",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "bsGho",
                      "name": "標籤",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "1",
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "asE4N",
                      "name": "值",
                      "fill": "#33292C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "不用任何迪士尼角色（米奇家族、公主們、皮克斯角色等）、也不做「看起來就是某個角色」的配色與比例（例：橘白條紋小丑魚、紅髮人魚、大圓耳朵）。小動物夥伴一律原創。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "mIdUy",
                  "name": "列-2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "dFGit",
                      "name": "標籤",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "content": "2",
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rLrl3",
                      "name": "值",
                      "fill": "#33292C",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "不放商標、城堡標誌（城堡上方的弧形光帶）、片名、樂園地標；城堡用原創輪廓。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "RvUwp",
                  "name": "列-3",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
